  "body": "## Goal\n\nPost a through die opening on the native Agie writer while preserving the surrounding plate. The current post qualifies the outside of a punch.\n\n## Work\n\nSelect the inner boundary of a single retained plate. Verify that the full-height opening in the solid matches that boundary. Place the threading hole and lead in the material to remove. The control must compensate toward the scrap and keep the surrounding plate. Check the smallest opening, the approach and the separation site for the selected wire technology.\n\nDone means: A synthetic plate with a through opening posts through the normal command and desktop workflow. The offline controller plots the cuts on the inside of the opening. Wrong-side starts, open or blind pockets and unverified geometries are refused before creating output.\n",
